# Copy to tool/.env.local and fill in whatever you have.
#
# Every value here is optional. tool/run-emulator.ps1 substitutes a placeholder for
# anything left blank and the app boots in free-tier mode, so a blank file is a valid
# starting point. tool/.env.local is gitignored; this example file is not. Never put a
# real key in here.

# RevenueCat public SDK keys, one per platform. With the placeholder value instead of a
# real one, Purchases.configure fails, init retries three times, and the app carries on
# in free-tier mode: paywall screens render but list no offerings.
REVENUECAT_ANDROID_KEY=
REVENUECAT_IOS_KEY=
